{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1068235-2e-spells-\u2013-same-effect-different-arcanum","id":1068235,"title":"[2E] Spells \u2013 Same effect, different Arcanum","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-26T04:11:22-07:00","id":1068235,"title":"[2E] Spells \u2013 Same effect, different Arcanum","content":"Topic for almost the same spells \u2013 you know them. They different in only the main Arcanum of it, but get\u2019s the same spell effect. Most of the time, they are about Ephemeral Entities. Here are some examples from 2E <b>Mage</b><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> corebook. Feel free to add your own.</span><br /> <br /> <b>Know Ephemera (Arcanum 1)</b><br /> <b>Practice:</b> Knowing<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Academics, Brawl, Socialize<br /> This spell allows the mage to glean a number of the following facts about a Ephemeral Entity equal to the Spell\u2019s Potency:<br /> \u2022 What is the entity\u2019s name?<br /> \u2022 What is its Rank?<br /> \u2022 What Manifestations does it possess?<br /> \u2022 What Numina does it possess?<br /> \u2022 What are its Influences, and roughly how strong are they?<br /> \u2022 What is its Ban or Bane?<br /> <b>Arcana:</b><br /> <b>Death 1</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Know Ephemera</i> on ghosts.<br /> <b>Mind 1</b> - Mage can cast <i>Know Ephemera</i> on goetia.<br /> <b>Spirit 1</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Know Ephemera</i> on spirits.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Command Ephemera (Arcanum 2)</b><br /> <b>Practice:</b> Ruling<br /> <b>Primary Factor:</b> Potency<br /> <b>Withstand:</b> Rank<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills: </b>Medicine, Athletics, Persuasion<br /> Sometimes the gentle approach must give way to raw dominance. This spell allows the mage to command a ephemeral entity to undertake a number of actions equal to the spell\u2019s Potency. This compulsion only lasts as long as the spell\u2019s Duration, so the entity might abandon an indefinite or extended action when the spell\u2019s Duration wears off. Commands that go against the entity\u2019s self-interest (including abandoning a host or Fetter) provoke a Clash of Wills. This spell has no effect on spirits above Rank 5.<br /> <b>Arcana:</b><br /> <b>Death 2</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Command Ephemera</i> on ghosts.<br /> <b>Mind 2</b> - Mage can cast <i>Command Ephemera</i> on goetia.<br /> <b>Spirit 2</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Command Ephemera</i> on spirits.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Familiar (Arcanum 4)</b><br /> <b>Practice:</b> Patterning<br /> <b>Primary Factor: </b>Duration<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills:</b> Athletics, Expression, Intimidate<br /> The mage creates a Familiar bond between an ephemeral entity and a mage, who must both be subjects of the spell. The entity may not be greater than Rank 2. The mage gains the Familiar Merit and the entity the Familiar Manifestation Condition for the Duration of the spell. Both parties must be willing, and can end the bond whenever they wish.<br /> <b>Arcana:</b><br /> <b>Death 4</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Familiar</i> on ghosts.<br /> <b>Mind 4 </b>- Mage can cast<i> Familiar</i> on goetia.<br /> <b>Spirit 4</b> \u2013 Mage can cast <i>Familiar</i> on spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-26T04:26:54-07:00","id":1068240,"title":"","content":"There are alot that go along the lines of the Ephemeral Enti